@! REGRESSION FIXTURE 1 of 2 - vendor-default stages = as this app generated it BEFORE 2026-09-24.
@! ERCOT (NOGRR282) preset, IT/UPS block. Option 1's own point (VDPA/DMA) is set from
@! ERCOT's shallowest mandatory row (0.90 pu / 2.00 s). VDPA1-3/DMA1-3 and VDUA1-3/TDUA1-3
@! carry the vendor-sample fixed defaults the app exported at the time, UNCHANGED - they do
@! not represent ERCOT's real envelope. PSS/E v35.6.4 against the compiled DLL confirmed
@! Option 3's stages are always evaluated, so this file trips earlier than its VDPA/DMA/
@! VDUA/TDUA alone suggest (see docs/developer/PERC1_MODEL.md "Option 3 is always live").
@! Kept as the known-bad half of tests/test_multistage_trip_regression.py.
@! Load ID fixed to '1' 2026-09-24 (was 'IT1', a 3-character id PSS/E's real
@! Load/USRLOD identifier field rejects).
@! ibus  LID  IT
100001 'USRLOD' '1' 'PERCBL' 12 1 2 173 33 250 0
@! ICON(M) ICON(M+1)  [ICON(M)=0 for 60 Hz, 1 for 50 Hz; ICON(M+1)=1 enables momentary
@! cessation (Option 2) in place of the undervoltage cease/reconnect (Option 1) used below]
 0 0
